WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.251
Where are we looking?

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:02.460
Everywhere. One over here.

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:03.837
Ready? One, Two...

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:13.138
Hey, what's up?

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:14.055
This is Vashtie

00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:15.765
and I'm directing

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:18.309
the very special She Got Game

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:20.770
It's my first time working with an all-female crew

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:23.565
and it's been amazing

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:24.566
I have to say

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:26.401
being able to, like, come together with all

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:28.653
these different women from so many different areas

00:00:28.653 --> 00:00:31.573
and sort of make this amazing project come to life

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:33.742
Um, we're about to go to location

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:37.829
and shoot a very lovely scene with Jewell Loyd

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:40.331
This is like me, normally

00:00:40.331 --> 00:00:41.624
When I'm on the court 

00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:42.625
I'm totally different

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:43.501
For sure!

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:45.128
I kind of flip the script a little

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:50.258
Are we recording?

00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:51.885
I always know where the camera's at

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:53.762
Alexis Morgan, reporter

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:55.597
We're here at the She Got Game set

00:00:55.597 --> 00:00:57.015
We're all getting ready

00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:05.857
[singing] I believe I can fly

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:09.903
One more time!

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:13.031
Faith Mothershed! She Got Game

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:14.616
My heart went BOOM BOOM BOOM!

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:17.077
And now the Jewell is going to be my

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:19.704
New- I'm gonna fan-girl her! 

00:01:19.704 --> 00:01:22.040
and I'm very excited to be included in this

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:25.085
Entire, whole, She Got Game thing

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:26.961
Now she shoots, she scores!

